actuar-fortran
===============

This project is a modern Fortran numerical-core translation derived from the
R package actuar 3.3-7.

Upstream package authors and contributors include Vincent Goulet, Christophe
Dutang, Mathieu Pigeon, Jeffrey A. Ryan, Robert Gentleman, Ross Ihaka, the R
Core Team, the R Foundation, and the other contributors recorded in the
retained upstream DESCRIPTION file.

The translated code is distributed under GNU GPL version 2 or later, matching
the upstream package license. The complete supplied upstream source is retained
under original/ and the supplied archive is retained under provenance/.

This is an independent Fortran port. It is not an official release of the
upstream actuar project.
